15	// DEVDESK-596: when the direct lookup of a named target fails and the Proxy row
16	// says a proxy applies, the DNS row is rewritten in place once the Proxy stage
17	// has run. Behind a mandatory proxy the name is often resolved by the proxy, so
18	// "does not resolve" alone would mislead. The Proxy stage keeps its place in the
19	// pipeline; it concludes on the earlier DNS row through stage.conclude.
